            "A stone of communication, calm and truth, said to help express ideas clearly and soothe. It is associated with the throat chakra and the sign of Sagittarius, is December's birthstone, and symbolises the fourth wedding anniversary. Cleansing in water; recharging in moonlight or gentle sunlight, without strong heat."
